{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-single-chart","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-single-chart","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.md","line":256,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.tex#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-single-chart","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-frame-chart-interface]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer-general]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer-manifold]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/formalization-support#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-chart-partition]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-radial-chart]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.tex","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-single-chart","line":718,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[a geodesic of a normal neighborhood, confined to one chart]\n  \\label{lem:dc-ch8-2-1-single-chart}\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch8-2-1-frame-chart-interface, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer-general, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer-manifold, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-chart-partition, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-radial-chart}\n\n\n  The conclusion needed by the transfer is the single-chart condition on each geodesic over\n  $[0,1]$ (or a finite chart-chain with compatible ODE data). The existence of such a chart\n  uniformly for the normal neighborhood is the remaining obligation.\n\\end{lemma}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[a geodesic of a normal neighborhood, confined to one chart] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-la